<title>USA: Kideo Productions Inc Q4 net loss steeper.</title>
<headline>Kideo Productions Inc Q4 net loss steeper.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>($000s except share and per share amounts)</p>
<p>				 Year Ended	  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				   July 31,		  July 31,</p>
<p>				   1996     1995	 1996	1995</p>
<p> Sales			    761	 521	   91	 95</p>
<p> Net loss		   (3,059)   (1,579)    (1,471)    (427)</p>
<p> Pro forma net loss     (3,133)   (1,917)    (1,471)    (508)</p>
